              - the main risks and the overall market sentiment;

              - the implications for each asset class (post-fixed income,
              inflation-linked bonds, credit, multimarket funds, Brazilian
              equities, international), as stated or clearly implied by the
              report;

              - which equity sectors the report sees as more exposed or more
              resilient.


