              "positions".

              - Never present the return of a class as the return of a subset of
              it, or the other way around. "Renda fixa (CDB)" is only the CDBs
              held directly; fixed income funds are a fund type.

              - A contribution in reais comes from weight and return together;
              say "weight" only when the asset's weight is clearly larger than
              the best performer's.

              - "highlights" already ranks the assets: best and worst performer
              by return, top and bottom contributor in reais.


